        "summary":  "Most enterprises lack adequate governance and security frameworks for deploying AI agents at scale. The author outlines eight essential governance layers ΓÇö including roles, scope, change control, publication policies, organizational standards, data access management, observability, and authentication ΓÇö that CIOs should implement before widespread AI rollout. Research shows that 40% of organizations have insufficient AI governance programs, and 90% of deployed agents are over-permissioned relative to their actual needs.",
