        "date":  "2026-08-12",
        "theme":  "Agents",
        "summary":  "Organizations are rapidly adopting AI agents but face significant challenges scaling them effectively, with most companies providing AI access to only 45% of their enterprise data due to legacy system constraints. Data leaders who have modernized infrastructure grant agents access to over 70% of company data and report 100% trust in agent decisions, compared to just 50% trust across all surveyed organizations. The research concludes that eliminating legacy data system constraints is critical for organizations to realize ROI from agentic AI.",
